+        compile_fn
+            A callable that takes the source string and returns the compiled
+            grammar.
+
+        Returns
+        -------
+        str
+            The compiled grammar.
+
+        Raises
+        ------
+        Exception
+            Any exception raised by *compile_fn* is propagated. Failed
+            compilations are not cached.
+
+        """
